## Key Equations

| Quantity | Equation |
|----------|----------|
| Conductive heat loss | Q = UA × (T_out − T_in) |
| Fan heat transfer | Q = ṁ × Cp × (T_out − T_in) |
| Fan mass flow | ṁ = ρ × V̇ = ρ × A × v |
| Fan power | P = P_max × (speed)³ |
| Thermal mass ODE | C_m × dT_m/dt = UA_m × (T_in − T_m) |
| Air ODE | C_air × dT_in/dt = ΣQ |
| AC energy | E_AC = Q_cooling / COP |
| CO₂ emissions | CO₂ = E_kWh × 0.386 kg/kWh |
